{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Worked examples for the PKM memory agents, rendered into each agent's request by agent id. Small on purpose: principles live in the manifests; each example anchors one principle and names the eval cases that grade it (never the same text, so the eval does not grade a memorized answer). Synthetic content only.",
